SOURCE[en]="Luonnonvarakeskus";
NOTE[en]("inventory")="The forest land and poorly productive forest land categories in NFI 1-NFI 3 do not fully correspond to present categories.";
NOTE[en]("land class")="Forestry land breaks down into forest land, poorly productive forest land and unproductive land according to its capability of producing volume increment. On forest land the capability is 1.0 m³/ha/year or more, on poorly productive forest land 0.1-1 m³/"
"ha/year and on unproductive land less than 0.1 m³/ha/year. Forestry land also includes nature conservation areas.";
VALUENOTE[en]("inventory","NFI 1 (1921-1924)")="Inventory results are calculated in accordance with present borders of Finland.";
VALUENOTE[en]("inventory","NFI 13 (2019-2023)")="The region of Åland measured in 2023. Municipalities of Inari, Utsjoki and Enontekiö were measured in 2022.";
VALUENOTE[en]("inventory","NFI 13/14 (2020-2024)")="- The data for Southern Finland, Northern Finland, whole country, and by region are based on VMI13/14 (2020-2024) measurements.#- The region of Åland measured in 2023 and Upper Lapland in 2022.";
CELLNOTE[en]("NFI 12 (2014-2018)","Lapland","*")=
"No NFI12 measurements in Enontekiö, Inari and Utsjoki region. Results are based on NFI11.";
